WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.012
All experiments run on three tasks drawn from the
Long Range Arena benchmark,

00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:07.657
chosen to stress long-sequence modeling.

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:13.874
These are byte-level binary text classification on
IMDb with sequences of one thousand tokens,

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:18.172
ListOps ten-way classification with
two-thousand-token sequences,

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:22.669
and byte-level document matching with
four-thousand-token sequences.

00:00:22.749 --> 00:00:27.695
The search considers nine candidate attention
mechanisms, including Bigbird,

00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:32.986
Linear Transformer, Linformer, Local attention,
Longformer, Performer, Reformer,

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.366
Sparse Transformer, and Synthesizer,

00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:40.260
with hyperparameters largely matching the original
Long Range Arena setup.
